Z||000003||Standard||03-18-2001||01:03 PM||||Now that I think about it I kinda remember another manufacturer.  Just makin' sure  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I have Avid Arch Supremes anyways... best freakin' brake I've ever used..||||reg||1
